    <label>Resolution</label>
    <type>Picklist</type>
    <required>true</required>
    <externalId>false</externalId>
    <description>How the conflict was resolved: Agent 1 Won (the requesting agent took the record), Agent 2 Won (the agent that claimed it first kept it), or Failed (an agent Id matched no registration). The framework no longer writes Queued; the value remains for records from earlier releases.</description>
